{"2067770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ICHARKO", "steam_appid": 2067770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067770/extras/5ef31cc8b792b25acd230bb7bce8b54d.poster.avif?t=1782204447\" width=616 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067770/extras/5ef31cc8b792b25acd230bb7bce8b54d.webm?t=1782204447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067770/extras/5ef31cc8b792b25acd230bb7bce8b54d.mp4?t=1782204447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Icharko</strong> you will have to fight the enemies right in the rear, step by step overcoming the tasks at hand. You are a soldier defending your country from invasion. Using exclusive weapons, you will be able to influence the course of the fighting, taking place in the most difficult times of your country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a single-player game</strong> in which you will visit many places and take part in various combat conflicts, playing the role of a militia military group in the most dangerous operations to defend your country. If you are killed, captured or detained, only your family will remember your existence. The whole plot is accompanied by an old man, who tells us about the military actions taking place in the 2000s, in which our protagonist participated. The old man will tell us about the bravery and courage in the military actions of the main character - Adam. All this in a first-person shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>History</strong> tells us about countries that started to take over each other. Large powers began to capture small countries, as they were defenseless and unarmed. This affected the protagonist as well. Plunge into the world of fighting, where an ordinary infantryman was able to affect a small part of faith in people. In the story there is a battle between the Fifth Order and the Order of the Legacy, where the army of the Fifth Order leads the capture of the land of the protagonist, and the Order of the Legacy is an army of militias that defend their land, which includes the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become that military hero</strong>- go through step-by-step tests, be tactful and think over every step before you go into the fray. Get a taste of the warfare of the 2000s, where major powers began to take over the lands of smaller countries. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In the game you can expect:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warfare in the period of the 2000s</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067770/extras/dcc5aafd8ed620881da95ec20626173c.avif?t=1782204447\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067770/extras_big/dcc5aafd8ed620881da95ec20626173c.avif?t=1782204447 width=1560 height=566 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The storyline is accompanied by a coworker of the protagonist<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067770/extras/0cd4dec78fb14e73f43824cd9901ed20.avif?t=1782204447\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067770/extras_big/0cd4dec78fb14e73f43824cd9901ed20.avif?t=1782204447 width=1560 height=566 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon customization<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067770/extras/c07deddb6ddbd8cf2355dbfdba73cb7a.avif?t=1782204447\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067770/extras_big/c07deddb6ddbd8cf2355dbfdba73cb7a.avif?t=1782204447 width=1560 height=566 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three levels of difficulty <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067770/extras/c4b3beb52cf55ecd884427f84c888a99.avif?t=1782204447\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067770/extras_big/c4b3beb52cf55ecd884427f84c888a99.avif?t=1782204447 width=1560 height=566 /></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067770/extras/5ef31cc8b792b25acd230bb7bce8b54d.poster.avif?t=1782204447\" width=616 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067770/extras/5ef31cc8b792b25acd230bb7bce8b54d.webm?t=1782204447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067770/extras/5ef31cc8b792b25acd230bb7bce8b54d.mp4?t=1782204447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Icharko</strong> you will have to fight the enemies right in the rear, step by step overcoming the tasks at hand. You are a soldier defending your country from invasion. Using exclusive weapons, you will be able to influence the course of the fighting, taking place in the most difficult times of your country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a single-player game</strong> in which you will visit many places and take part in various combat conflicts, playing the role of a militia military group in the most dangerous operations to defend your country. If you are killed, captured or detained, only your family will remember your existence. The whole plot is accompanied by an old man, who tells us about the military actions taking place in the 2000s, in which our protagonist participated. The old man will tell us about the bravery and courage in the military actions of the main character - Adam. All this in a first-person shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>History</strong> tells us about countries that started to take over each other. Large powers began to capture small countries, as they were defenseless and unarmed. This affected the protagonist as well. Plunge into the world of fighting, where an ordinary infantryman was able to affect a small part of faith in people. In the story there is a battle between the Fifth Order and the Order of the Legacy, where the army of the Fifth Order leads the capture of the land of the protagonist, and the Order of the Legacy is an army of militias that defend their land, which includes the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become that military hero</strong>- go through step-by-step tests, be tactful and think over every step before you go into the fray. Get a taste of the warfare of the 2000s, where major powers began to take over the lands of smaller countries. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In the game you can expect:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warfare in the period of the 2000s</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067770/extras/dcc5aafd8ed620881da95ec20626173c.avif?t=178220444